  "tama.help.mistakes_t": "Care mistakes & evolution",
  "tama.help.mistakes": "A heart left empty for 15 minutes is a care mistake. If your pet acts up for no reason, it's a fake call – only discipline helps. Few mistakes and a high imprint make an Alpha, many make it feral. Perfect care might awaken a secret form …",
  "tama.help.ark_t": "ARK extras",
  "tama.help.ark": "Imprinting like in ARK: your pet wants cuddles, walks or specific food – fulfil it before it expires. The cryopod pauses everything, e.g. on vacation. Adults can have offspring, sometimes with a color mutation. The dossier collects all 217 species.",
  "tama.help.history_t": "Then & now",
  "tama.help.history": "In 1996 the Tamagotchi hung on a keychain: three buttons, eight icons, beeping calls – forget it and you lost it. Modern devices like the Uni (2023) and Paradise (2025) add color screens, personalities, collections and online meeting places. Your Dino Tamagotchi combines both: classic rules or relaxed everyday play, plus retro LCD, dossier and the tribe pen.",
